   "source": [
    "## 2. The corpus in time — decision years\n",
    "\n",
    "The shape of the corpus governs how every later figure should be read: it is thin before 1850,\n",
    "grows through the twentieth century, peaks in the 1980s–90s, and thins again at the very end.\n",
    "The right-hand panel is the same series as a cumulative share, which is the quickest way to see\n",
    "how little of the corpus the early centuries hold."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "3f37b2f7",
   "metadata": {},
